# Rockafellar, Part VI: Constrained Extremum Problems

This module collects §§27–32 of [rockafellar1970convex], which the book prints as Part VI: the
minimum of a convex function, ordinary convex programs and Lagrange multipliers, bifunctions and
generalized convex programs, adjoint bifunctions and dual programs, Fenchel's duality theorem, and
the maximum of a convex function. All 63 numbered results of Part VI are formalized.

